<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Traffic sign catalog of Turkey for Traffic Engine (Xerces-C reads this file).

  key       Stable internal name. The .te files store the key. Do not change a key.
  code      Official code (KGM, Trafik İşaretleri El Kitabı). Sources of this version: the list of the
            signs of Turkey on Wikipedia (English and Turkish), with the official codes of the sign files.
  name      STE English name. name_tr: official Turkish name.
  category  warning (T), regulatory (TT, prohibition), mandatory (TT, blue), information (B), parking (P)
  shape     triangle, triangle_down, circle, octagon, square, rect, diamond, board (tall marker),
            board_wide (bend marker), saltire (level crossing cross)
  symbol    the drawing inside the sign (see src/sign_painter.cpp)
  text      text of the symbols text / letter, or the value text of a limit sign (for example "3.5 m")
  mirror    true: the pictogram is mirrored (left / right variants)
  slash     true: a red diagonal bar ("end of ...")
  panel     true: a white panel in a blue service sign
  effect    the change in the traffic: speed_limit, end_speed_limit, stop, yield, priority_road,
            end_priority_road, no_entry, road_closed, no_overtaking, end_no_overtaking, no_left,
            no_right, no_uturn, only_straight, only_left, only_right, straight_or_right,
            straight_or_left, left_or_right, end_all (empty = information only)
  value     default value (speed in km/h)

  Not in the list: direction and location panels (B-5 .. B-13, B-54), supplementary plates (PL),
  road works signs (YB) and the variants that differ only in the text of a panel.
-->
